# Call a Cloud Function

This note is derived from the Firebase snippet set and explains the core idea behind **Call a Cloud Function**.

## Why it matters
Triggering a Firebase Cloud Function from the client.

## Example
```firebase
import { getFunctions, httpsCallable } from 'firebase/functions';

const functions = getFunctions();
const addMessage = httpsCallable(functions, 'addMessage');

addMessage({ text: 'Hello World' })
  .then((result) => {
    console.log('Function response:', result.data);
  });
```

